daisugi, daisugi-gate and conform (clients/go) link the following third-party code
statically. Each is built from the pinned source archive named here by
scripts/native.sh, which checks the SHA-256 before it builds anything.

Z3 5.1.0 (the z3-solver 5.1.0.0 source archive)
  https://github.com/Z3Prover/z3/releases/download/z3-5.1.0/z3_solver-5.1.0.0.tar.gz
  sha256 269a0bf62949d227a16ab42afee6750f18477e173a14de6aeaf8789f33f813b5
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation

tree-sitter 0.26.0 (the py-tree-sitter source archive; the C runtime)
  https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/source/t/tree-sitter/tree_sitter-0.26.0.tar.gz
  sha256 b40c219edccc4564530c96f8f1556f6202b37cda964d1cbd7bd2b7e68b40a245
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2019 Max Brunsfeld, GitHub
  The runtime's Unicode tables (lib/src/unicode) are under the Unicode
  License (ICU 58 and later), Copyright (c) 1991-2019 Unicode, Inc.

tree-sitter-bash 0.25.1 (the grammar's source archive)
  https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/source/t/tree-sitter-bash/tree_sitter_bash-0.25.1.tar.gz
  sha256 bfc0bdaa77bc1e86e3c6652e5a6e140c40c0a16b84185c2b63ad7cd809b88f14
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2017 Max Brunsfeld

LLVM libc++, libc++abi and libunwind, as shipped with zig 0.16.0 (Z3 is
compiled with `zig c++`, and these are linked with it)
  License: Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions

golang.org/x/text v0.30.0 (Unicode NFKC normalization)
  License: BSD-3-Clause
  Copyright 2009 The Go Authors

github.com/mattn/go-sqlite3 v1.14.52 (daisugi only: the pathway store and
the trace journal), a Go module pinned by go.sum, not by native.sh; its cgo
code compiles the SQLite amalgamation it bundles (SQLite 3.53.4) into the
binary
  License: MIT (go-sqlite3); SQLite itself is in the public domain
  Copyright (c) 2014 Yasuhiro Matsumoto

The full license texts ship inside each source archive (Z3:
core/LICENSE.txt; tree-sitter: LICENSE and tree_sitter/core/lib/src/unicode/
LICENSE; tree-sitter-bash: LICENSE; the LLVM runtimes:
LICENSE.TXT in zig's lib/libcxx, lib/libcxxabi and lib/libunwind;
golang.org/x/text: LICENSE; go-sqlite3: LICENSE).

Not linked, fetched on first use: daisugi's potion matcher downloads
minishlab/potion-base-8M (revision bf8b056651a2c21b8d2565580b8569da283cab23,
three files pinned by sha256 in internal/embed/potion) from Hugging Face
into $XDG_CACHE_HOME/opendaisugi/models. The model is MIT licensed (its
model card, https://huggingface.co/minishlab/potion-base-8M).

The Go standard library and runtime, linked into every Go binary
  https://go.dev/LICENSE
  License: BSD-3-Clause (the same text applies to golang.org/x/text)

